    }
}
```
Notice that running this code will allocate 1024 locations in memory for your array, but the for loop will likely show that not all values therein are 0 . It’s always best practice to be aware of the potential for garbage values when you do not initialize blocks of memory to some other value like zero or otherwise. You can download this code here .

