[Valgrind] - Valgrind is a tool that can check to see if there are memory-related issues with your programs wherein you utilized malloc . Specifically, it checks to see if you free all the memory you allocated.
- Consider the following code for memory.c :
memory.c
```
// Demonstrates memory errors via valgrind

